OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,FA teenager who left a prison officer
OL,7,Fwith life-changing injuries after
OL,8,Fthrowing boiling water at him has been
OL,9,Fhanded an 18-month detention and
OL,10,Ftraining sentence.
OL,12,FThe 17-year-old, a detainee at
OL,13,FWetherby Young Offender Institution,
OL,14,Fthrew a kettle of boiling sugared
OL,15,Fwater at Martin Fowler when he brought
OL,16,Fhim his breakfast on 14 June last year.
OL,18,FThe long-serving prison officer Martin
OL,19,FFowler was forced to take three months
OL,20,Foff work following burns to his body,
OL,21,Farm and neck.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G1/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,FThe teenager, who previously pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty to causing actual bodily harm,
OL,8,Fappeared at Leeds Magistrates' Court
OL,9,Fby videolink from the West Yorkshire
OL,10,Fdetention facility for sentencing.
OL,12,FSugar had been added to the water to
OL,13,Fmake the injuries worse, the court
OL,14,Fheard.
OL,16,FJudge Daniel Curtis told the youth:
OL,17,F"This is a prison officer who, on your
OL,18,Fown admissions and in your apology
OL,19,Fletter, you say helped you when you
OL,20,Fcame into prison.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G2/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,F"This was a prison officer of 17
OL,7,Fyears. This will not be the first time
OL,8,Fhe has been assaulted and sadly it
OL,9,Fprobably will not be the last before
OL,10,Fhe retires from that line of work.
OL,12,F"Prison officers put themselves in the
OL,13,Ffront line, just like police officers
OL,14,Fand other emergency workers.
OL,16,F"They come to work. They put on a
OL,17,Fshirt and a tie.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G3/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,F"They do not have personal protective
OL,7,Fequipment, unless they are dealing
OL,8,Fwith a particularly violent incident,
OL,9,Fand there was absolutely no reason for
OL,10,Fthis officer to suspect what was about
OL,11,Fto come his way on June 14 when he
OL,12,Fknocked on your door to give you your
OL,13,Fbreakfast pack."
OL,15,FTwo female officers who were standing
OL,16,Feither side of Mr Fowler felt a
OL,17,F"stinging sensation" as the water also
OL,18,Fhit them on the arms but left no
OL,19,Finjury, the prosecution said.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G4/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,FIn a statement heard by the court, Mr
OL,7,FFowler said: "If it had gone in my
OL,8,Fface and eyes, things could have been
OL,9,Fdifferent.
OL,11,FThe officer said parts of his skin
OL,12,Fhave changed colour and while it does
OL,13,Fnot cause him physical pain or
OL,14,Fdiscomfort it is a "lasting reminder
OL,15,Fof what happened to me".
OL,17,FThe viewing window of the cell door
OL,18,Fwas covered with paper when the prison
OL,19,Fofficers approached.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G5/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,FMr Fowler removed the paper and spoke
OL,7,Fto the detainee who was not holding
OL,8,Fanything and was not deemed to be a
OL,9,Fthreat.
OL,11,FProsecutor Charles Macrae said:
OL,12,F"Officer Fowler then unlocked and
OL,13,Fopened the cell door and as soon as
OL,14,Fthe door was opened (the detainee) was
OL,15,Fseen by Prison Officer Fowler and the
OL,16,Fother prison officers to reach to his
OL,17,Fright and pick up a prison-issued
OL,18,Fkettle.
OL,20,F"He then threw water from the kettle
OL,21,Fover the officers.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G6/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33507
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,F"The vast majority of the water has
OL,7,Flanded on the upper body of Prison
OL,8,FOfficer Fowler who has immediately
OL,9,Ffelt a scalding sensation and removed
OL,10,Fhis top to try and alleviate that
OL,11,Fpain."
OL,13,FMr Fowler slammed the door shut.
OL,15,FThirteen empty packets of sugar were
OL,16,Ffound in a bin bag when the teenager's
OL,17,Froom was searched.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G7/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,FHe has written a letter to the
OL,7,Fofficer, saying he is "truly sorry"
OL,8,Fand adding: "I like you, because you
OL,9,Fhelped me when I first came into
OL,10,Fprison.
OL,12,F"I apologise for doing what I did. I
OL,13,Fdid not mean to cause you harm.
OL,15,F"The previous day I got group
OL,16,Fassaulted and I was still in the
OL,17,Fheightened and emotional state. I
OL,18,Fcouldn't go to sleep that night
OL,19,Fbecause my head was hurting from the
OL,20,Fbeating. I was not thinking clearly.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G8/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BYorks News CReg TV FThis Day
FL,336,330,260,120,000,100
PN,33509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F335A1785349119
OL,3,CTeen who threw boiling water at prison
OL,4,Cofficer sentenced
OL,6,F"I look back at my actions with regret.
OL,8,F"I hope you can forgive me for this
OL,9,Fmistake and hope to make it up in
OL,10,Ffuture."
OL,12,FThe prosecution said the teenager is
OL,13,Fserving a 35-month sentence with an
OL,14,Fextension and there had been a
OL,15,Frehabilitation order that was not
OL,16,Fcomplied with.
OL,1,Woz5~k4{$z%~s1z5jw=hw1         G9/9
OL,2,W,.!+.!/*%/*%,.!/*%/*%/"-$T,,,,,,,,,,,,,
